abstract: "Witnesses giving an upper bound of 143, a checked LRAT certificate giving a lower bound of 134, and a finite certificate establishing 144 as the minimum among C9-invariant maximal matchings. The unrestricted exact value and novelty remain unresolved."
keywords:
  - associahedron
  - maximal matching
  - edge domination
  - certificate verification
